    {
      "id": "sec_s1l19_lbl1",
      "type": "section_label",
      "data": {
        "text": "Darj zail alfaaz par ghaur karein, unki banawat aur ma'ani ko dekhein:",
        "title": "Darj zail alfaaz par ghaur karein, unki banawat aur ma'ani ko dekhein:",
        "label": "Darj zail alfaaz par ghaur karein, unki banawat aur ma'ani ko dekhein:"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_s1l19_r3",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Upar diye gaye alfaaz mein chand baatein mushtarak (ek jaisi) hain: Har lafz chaar huroof par mushtamil hai, har lafz ke shuru mein (أَ) hai, aur sab par aaraab (harakat) ek jaise hain. Arabi mein iss wazan (أَفْعَلُ) par aane wale alfaaz Ism-e-Tafzeel (Superlative) hote hain, jin mein kisi sift ki inteha ya sabse zyada hone ka ma'ana paida hota hai. Yeh alfaaz logon ke naamon ke taur par bhi aam istemal hote hain, jaise Akram (sabse ba-izzat) ya Afzal (sabse behtar).",
        "content": "Upar diye gaye alfaaz mein chand baatein mushtarak (ek jaisi) hain: Har lafz chaar huroof par mushtamil hai, har lafz ke shuru mein (أَ) hai, aur sab par aaraab (harakat) ek jaise hain. Arabi mein iss wazan (أَفْعَلُ) par aane wale alfaaz Ism-e-Tafzeel (Superlative) hote hain, jin mein kisi sift ki inteha ya sabse zyada hone ka ma'ana paida hota hai. Yeh alfaaz logon ke naamon ke taur par bhi aam istemal hote hain, jaise Akram (sabse ba-izzat) ya Afzal (sabse behtar).",
        "hinglish_text": "Upar diye gaye alfaaz mein chand baatein mushtarak (ek jaisi) hain: Har lafz chaar huroof par mushtamil hai, har lafz ke shuru mein (أَ) hai, aur sab par aaraab (harakat) ek jaise hain. Arabi mein iss wazan (أَفْعَلُ) par aane wale alfaaz Ism-e-Tafzeel (Superlative) hote hain, jin mein kisi sift ki inteha ya sabse zyada hone ka ma'ana paida hota hai. Yeh alfaaz logon ke naamon ke taur par bhi aam istemal hote hain, jaise Akram (sabse ba-izzat) ya Afzal (sabse behtar)."
      }
    },
